values ('bbbb0002-0000-4000-8000-000000000025', 'en', null, 'Rust Programming', 'Learn to write fast, memory-safe systems code in Rust: the ownership model that guarantees safety without a garbage collector, borrowing and lifetimes, structs and enums, pattern matching, error handling with Result and Option, generics and traits, and iterators. Every lesson uses real, compilable Rust snippets. Structure adapted from the open ''The Rust Programming Language'' book (MIT/Apache-2.0); all explanations original.', null, 'career', 37, true, 'technology', '{bbbb0002-0000-4000-8000-000000000002}')
